==Strategy==
Save up some cash early on while keeping an eye on the Znaches that can burrow extremely far and potentially reach your base. Zigge is a bit of an annoyance, her burrow range is very short and she has a high chance for a knockback. This means that he can get in between your DPS units and Meatshields and tear up your backlines. If you can, use your [[Cat Cannon]] to intercept her burrow.

When Zory spawns, you will want to keep him from immediately reaching your base on your DPS, so save [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] for when he surfaces. Only 1 Zory spawns, but he hits hard enough to warrant caution. More Zigges can spawn at this time and really mess up your spawn flow.

